  "title": "Kourovka problem 20.29 (main)",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "Let S be a non-abelian finite simple group. Is it true that for any n ∈ N, if\nthe set of class sizes of a centreless finite group G is the same as the set of class sizes\nof the direct power S n , then G ≃ S n ?\n    This is proved for S = Alt25 in (J. Algebra Appl., 21, no. 11 (2022), Article ID\n2250226, 8 p.).                                                            I. B. Gorshkov",
